  npcAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  npcName: Fisherwoman
  nodes:
  - id: fw_rdy
    text: You found it! Oh dear you have no idea how much this means to me! Words
      can not express my gratitude. Ask me whatever you want to know. Now it's my
      turn to be of service!
    choices:
    - label: What was the pope doing here?
      nextNodeID: fw_poploc
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Have you heard of the holy radio?
      nextNodeID: fw_holrad
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Where to look for artefacts?
      nextNodeID: fw_arte
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter:
    - {fileID: 11400000, guid: be727f535edf04ed6abbb40c5db060e6, type: 2}
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: fw_poploc
    text: I don't think anyone knows exactly. Some guess it has to do with some godly
      trials for all of us. Others speculate that he was visiting a childhood friend...
      We will probably never find out.
    choices:
    - label: Have you heard of the holy radio?
      nextNodeID: fw_holrad
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Where to look for artefacts?
      nextNodeID: fw_arte
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: fw_holrad
    text: I don't think I have. Sounds more like a gadget than an artefact. If I
      would have to guess what it is. I would think that it's radio channel for believers
      like the malarkey Bibel TV.
    choices:
    - label: What was the pope doing here?
      nextNodeID: fw_poploc
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Where to look for artefacts?
      nextNodeID: fw_arte
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - label: Leave
      nextNodeID: 
      actionsOnChoose:
      - {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2e042ea431fc0410ab65ad4e53a6af14, type: 2}
      wwiseEvent:
        idInternal: 0
        valueGuidInternal: 
        WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
    actionsOnEnter: []
    wwiseEvent:
      idInternal: 0
      valueGuidInternal: 
      WwiseObjectReference: {fileID: 0}
  - id: fw_arte
    text: Your best chance is in between those moutains here. They are difficult
      to maneuver though. Be careful! But on the other hand, that is what many sailors
      think that is why they leave them alone. Only sentimental women like me get
      lost here.
    choices:
    - label: What was the pope doing here?
      nextNodeID: fw_poploc
      actionsOnChoose: []
      wwiseEvent:
